WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.468
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.670
I am here with Amy Poehler,
and we're about to play

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.071
a round of Instant Spoilers.

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:10.377
-♪ Instant spoilers,
instant spoilers ♪

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:13.879
-This is a really fun game.
We played it with Tom Holland.

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:16.382
-Oh, I love Tom Holland.
He's the best.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:18.851
-I know, me, too.
He is the best. I love him.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:20.719
Now, Amy, we each have
a stack of cards

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:22.822
with movie titles on them.
When it's your turn,

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.691
you have to draw a card,
and you have to

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.292
shout out a spoiler
for that movie.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.461
And the other person
tries to guess the movie,

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.863
based only on the spoiler.
Sound good?

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.333
-Let's do it.
-Alright, Amy,

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.935
you'll be guessing first,
and have to guess

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:38.238
as many as possible
before time runs out.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:42.608
Ready, on the clock, and go.

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:46.412 line:68%
Uh, Bruce Willis was dead
the whole time.

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.281 line:68%
-Uh, "Die hard."
[ Buzzer ]

00:00:49.281 --> 00:00:53.719 line:68%
-Uh, no, "Sixth Sense."
Sorry.

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:56.355 line:68%
"Die hard"?
-Well, "Die Hard" has "die"

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:57.490 line:68%
in the title, so...
okay, let's keep going.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:01.894 line:68%
-Here we go.
The boat sinks at the end.

00:01:01.894 --> 00:01:04.964 line:68%
-Oh, um, "Gilligan's Island."
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:08.234 line:76%
-No.
-Are you sure?

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.804 line:76%
-That's a TV show.
-Alright.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:13.906 line:76%
-Next, here we go.
-Potayto, potahto.

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:18.445 line:76%
Here we go.
-Uh, uh, they -- they find Nemo.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.879 line:76%
[ Laughs ]
-Oh, "The Little Mermaid."

00:01:20.879 --> 00:01:22.181 line:76%
[ Buzzer ]
-No.

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:24.616 line:76%
I said it, actually.
-No, wait, "The Big Mermaid."

00:01:24.616 --> 00:01:26.552 line:76%
[ Buzzer ]
-No, they find Nemo.

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:29.288 line:76%
-Oh, okay,
"The Big Mermaid 2."

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:31.490 line:76%
[ Buzzer ]
-Aw, man.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:35.861 line:76%
Amy, you got a total of
zero answers correct.

00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:37.664 line:76%
-Hmm.
-Um...

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.999 line:76%
You know, you've seen movies
before.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.501 line:78%
You know what movies are, right?

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.170 line:76%
-Yeah, I thought that buzzer
sound meant that I got it.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.272 line:76%
It means I didn't get it?
-No, I guess not.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:48.107 line:76%
-Okay.
Well, to be fair, Jimmy,

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:50.910 line:76%
your spoilers could use
a little bit of work.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.979 line:76%
-Yeah, well, I don't know.
When Tom and I played,

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:55.915 line:76%
he got like 5 points.
-Yeah, well, I'm sorry

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:58.051 line:76%
I'm not [Bleep] Tom Holland.
Okay?

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:00.920 line:76%
-Alright, let me show you
how it's done here.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.122 line:76%
Let's get that clock
back up on the screen.

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:05.991 line:76%
Amy, whenever you are ready,
come on.

00:02:05.991 --> 00:02:07.660 line:76%
-Here we go.
-Yeah.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:11.530 line:76%
-Okay, Iron Man snaps
and kills Thanos.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.065 line:76%
-"Notting Hill."
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:15.568 line:76%
"Peter's Friends."
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.436 line:76%
-No.
-"Four Weddings and a Funeral"?

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:18.971 line:76%
[ Buzzer ]
I don't know, pass.

00:02:18.971 --> 00:02:22.075 line:76%
-Oh, okay, alright.
Okay, you're gonna get this one.

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:24.777 line:76%
Gwyneth Paltrow's head
is in the box.

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.713 line:76%
-"Sex and the City 2."
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:30.783 line:78%
-No, but I thought that, too.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.651 line:76%
I did think it was that.
-Yeah.

00:02:32.651 --> 00:02:34.554 line:76%
It's not that?
-Okay. No.

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:37.089 line:78%
Okay, here's a good spoiler.

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:39.758 line:76%
The killer is
Jason Voorhees' mother.

00:02:39.758 --> 00:02:41.995 line:76%
-"Ernest Goes to Camp."
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:44.163 line:76%
-No.
No, different camp movie.

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:45.965 line:76%
-"Meatballs"!
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:47.934 line:76%
-Mnh-mnh.
Different camp movie.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.002 line:76%
-"Camp Nowhere."
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:51.604 line:76%
[ Buzzer ]
-No. Different camp movie.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.606 line:76%
-"Heavyweights."
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:55.341 line:78%
-No. Different camp movie.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:56.943 line:76%
-"Wet Hot American Summer."
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.244 line:76%
-I don't know.
I've never heard of it.

00:02:59.244 --> 00:03:01.247 line:76%
[ Buzzer ]
-Hey, is it just me,

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:04.317 line:76%
or is the buzzer getting
louder and, like, meaner?

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:06.719 line:76%
-It is, it is.
The buzzer is aggressive.

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.254 line:76%
But, honestly,
it does make sense,

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.623 line:76%
because you did do
even worse than I did.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.658 line:76%
-I don't know
what's going on over here.

00:03:12.658 --> 00:03:15.461 line:76%
By now, Tom Holland and I
had, like --

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:18.130 line:76%
-You know what, Jimmy?
Why don't you marry Tom Holland?

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.066 line:76%
Why don't you go and marry him
if you love him so much.

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:21.567 line:76%
-He lives in England.
-Okay.

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:25.838 line:64%
-Um...we have one round left.

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:28.407 line:68%
Let's see how many
we can get this, together.

00:03:28.407 --> 00:03:29.909 line:68%
This is a partnership.
Here we go.

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:32.211 line:68%
All we have to do
is get one answer right.

00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:36.415 line:68%
Just one, and I will be happy.
-Okay, me too.

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:38.917 line:68%
-Yeah, that's all I want
is us to be happy.

00:03:38.917 --> 00:03:40.719 line:68%
Are you ready for this?
-Yeah.

00:03:40.719 --> 00:03:41.887 line:68%
-Here we go.
-I'm ready.

00:03:41.887 --> 00:03:46.258 line:21%
-Okay. Oh, gosh. Oh...

00:03:46.258 --> 00:03:49.962 line:15%
well, it has, like, a beginning
and then a middle...

00:03:49.962 --> 00:03:52.097 line:21%
-Uh, "Tree of Life."

00:03:52.097 --> 00:03:53.432 line:15%
Terrence Malick's
"Tree of Life."

00:03:53.432 --> 00:03:54.967 line:23%
[ Bell dings ]
-Yes! Yes!

00:03:54.967 --> 00:03:57.002 line:23%
That's it!
We did it! We did it!

00:03:57.002 --> 00:03:59.372 line:28%
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:02.608
-Suck it, Tom Holland!
-Suck it, Tom Holland!

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:05.878
-Coming for you, Spider-Man!
-Oh, yeah!

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:08.347
Well, we're gonna be right back
with more "Tonight Show,"

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:09.715
